# 💎 Gemstone_FYP – AI Powered Gemstone Marketplace

GemVision AI is a full-stack Django web application that combines Artificial Intelligence with an online gemstone marketplace. Users can verify gemstones using an AI model, list gemstones for sale, communicate with buyers and sellers through real-time messaging, and manage their marketplace activities securely.

---

# 🚀 Features

## 🔐 User Authentication

* Custom User Model
* User Registration
* Email OTP Verification
* Secure Login & Logout
* Profile Management

---

## 🤖 AI Gemstone Identification

* Upload gemstone images
* TensorFlow AI model predicts gemstone type
* Supports multiple gemstone classes
* AI-powered verification before listing

