# ⚙️ Installation

## 1. Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/GemVision-AI.git
cd GemVision-AI
```

---

## 2. Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

### Linux / macOS

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

### Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

---

## 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## 4. Run Migrations

```bash
python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate
```

---

## 5. Create Superuser

```bash
python manage.py createsuperuser
```

---

## 6. Start Redis

Linux:

```bash
sudo systemctl start redis-server
```

Verify Redis:

```bash
redis-cli ping
```

Expected output:

```text
PONG
```

---

## 7. Run the Project

Start the application using Daphne (ASGI server):

```bash
daphne -b 0.0.0.0 -p 8000 Gemstone_FYP.asgi:application
```

Open your browser:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

